'''Playing with Lasers''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to clear the [[Jewelled_Crab|Crystal Crabs]] without wasting a single orb after activating the first crystal.

This task is best completed in a group as solo encounters require the player to bind the crabs in place repeatedly with a [[hammer]] and the layout of the room may be unfeasible for completing it.

